379
00:21:51,440 --> 00:21:52,220
Oh...

380
00:21:52,240 --> 00:21:53,440
Drove this good boy here.

381
00:21:53,640 --> 00:21:54,340
Jam,

382
00:21:54,970 --> 00:21:55,880
