the farm's water control system.

384
00:21:59,870 --> 00:22:00,610
And Mr. Wasin,

385
00:22:00,630 --> 00:22:01,400
this is Jam.

386
00:22:01,430 --> 00:22:02,010
Hello.

387
00:22:02,040 --> 00:22:03,450
Hello, Wasin.

388
00:22:03,630 --> 00:22:04,270
With this one,

389
00:22:04,290 --> 00:22:05,640
show him the ropes as much as you like.

390
00:22:05,840 --> 00:22:07,340
Make sure he knows

391
00:22:07,360 --> 00:22:08,770
all of the ins and outs of this farm.

392
00:22:09,220 --> 00:22:10,040
Absolutely.

393
00:22:10,300 --> 00:22:12,720
By the way...who's Mr. Jam?

394
00:22:13,610 --> 00:22:15,040
He's the new owner of Adisuan Farm.

395
00:22:16,190 --> 00:22:17,010
Hey...

396
00:22:17,940 --> 00:22:19,330
Listen, Jam.

397
00:22:20,190 --> 00:22:22,290
Work hard and make your boss proud
for sending you here.

398
00:22:22,340 --> 00:22:23,830
I'll pick you up for lunch at noon.

399
00:22:25,170 --> 00:22:26,530
I will pass, actually.

400
00:22:26,760 --> 00:22:28,330
I will get my own lunch

401
00:22:28,630 --> 00:22:29,660
so you do not have to come.

402
00:22:31,700 --> 00:22:32,410
I can't.

403
00:22:32,580 --> 00:22:33,730
I need to earn good-boy points

404
00:22:33,870 --> 00:22:36,170
so I can get promoted
from the Pak Chong branch spouse

405
00:22:36,190 --> 00:22:37,190
to your number one.

406
00:22:38,320 --> 00:22:39,360
Do not come any closer.

407
00:22:39,640 --> 00:22:42,120
You are but the Pak Chong branch spouse.

408
00:22:42,750 --> 00:22:43,620
You...

409
00:22:43,640 --> 00:22:44,950
Keeping your chubby cheeks all to yourself?

410
00:22:44,970 --> 00:22:47,070
Well, you belong to no one
but this Pak Chong branch spouse.

411
00:22:47,110 --> 00:22:48,380
Mr. Sarm!

412
00:22:48,470 --> 00:22:49,310
See you.

413
00:22:49,730 --> 00:22:50,730
I'll leave him to you.

414
00:22:55,030 --> 00:22:57,260
Mr. Sarm is actually a gentle soul.

415
00:22:57,320 --> 00:22:58,320
I believe...

416
00:22:58,440 --> 00:22:59,930
